      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<b>Ray</b> selects at a distance for UI and 3D objects. It aims with
        the system <color=#64B5F6>Pointer Pose</color>, a stable filtered ray, valid
        only while <color=#64B5F6>IsPointerPoseValid</color>.

        <color=#8BC34A><b>Try:</b>
        point at the panel from afar and pinch to select.</color>'
